		{"id":"3d3c8cbd5607f6e3","type":"text","text":"finds strange artifact, punches it cause curious and mischievous","x":-1180,"y":33,"width":250,"height":110},
		{"id":"f670324464afe47a","type":"text","text":"teleported to vibrant ice sonic level, learns basic mechanics has fun, and collects snacks","x":-1180,"y":172,"width":250,"height":140},
		{"id":"b7e97605d986c6ed","type":"text","text":"throughout level, see vague hints at the worlds lore","x":-1180,"y":340,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"2ddf678fb5d507f0","type":"text","text":"Glitches start appearing","x":-1180,"y":432,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"489f147882f99994","type":"text","text":"At the end, see a green meadow in the middle of the ice level. meet mysterious silhouetted woman, drinking tea under umbrella. She talks to pengu, and says it's time to wake up","x":-1180,"y":520,"width":250,"height":240},
		{"id":"4efbbf2e505edf52","type":"text","text":"Beginning","x":-1068,"y":-620,"width":250,"height":60},
